BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//notapattern//calendar export 1.0//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:School Girls\; Or\, the African Mean Girls Play
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:School Girls\; Or\, the African Mean Girls Play
DTSTART:20261020T233000Z
DTEND:20261021T005000Z
DTSTAMP:20261019T042843Z
UID:1007090
DESCRIPTION:<p>Becoming Miss Ghana 1986 would mean fame\, fortune\, and pr
 osperity. At least\, that&rsquo\;s what Paulina&mdash\;the queen bee of Ab
 uri Girls Boarding School&mdash\;believes. When the pageant recruiter come
 s to school\, Paulina and her crew pull out all the stops. But to their su
 rprise\, a new transfer student from America kicks the competition into a 
 higher\, far more personal gear. Arriving on Broadway for the first time n
 early a decade after its Off-Broadway premiere\, <em>School Girls\; Or\, T
 he African Mean Girls Play</em> reunites the powerhouse team behind <em>Ja
 ja&rsquo\;s African Hair Braiding</em>&mdash\;Tony Award-nominated playwri
 ght Jocelyn Bioh and Tony Award-nominated director Whitney White&mdash\;fo
 r this bright\, biting comedy.</p>
LOCATION:Samuel J. Friedman Theatre\, 261 West 47th Street \, New York NY 
 10036
URL:https://www.telecharge.com/School-Girls-Or-The-African-Mean-Girls-Play
 -Tickets
END:VEVENT
